{"code":"222980","name":"한국맥널티","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"식품","sector_desc":"가공식품 제조. 경기 방어적이며 원재료(곡물) 가격과 해외 판매 확대가 실적 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1997년 설립되어 커피 제조 및 가공을 하며, 2015년 코스닥시장에 상장함. 2020년 제약사업 부문을 물적분할하여 맥널티제약을 설립하고, 맥널티바이오, 맥널티인터내셔널 등 자회사를 통해 사업을 다각화하고 있음. 커피 생두 수입부터 가공까지 수직 계열화된 사업 구조를 갖추고, 원두커피, 인스턴트, 액상 커피음료 등 일괄 생산 라인을 국내 유일하게 구축하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-23","n_days":300,"close":1775.0,"open":1752.0,"high":1792.0,"low":1701.0,"volume":4545,"amount":8067375.0,"ret_1d":0.5096,"gap":-0.7928,"range_pct":5.1268,"ret_5":-5.5851,"ret_20":-21.978,"ret_60":-18.9498,"ret_120":-33.6449,"ret_250":-51.2363,"ma20":1977.1,"ma60":2109.3667,"ma120":2106.4583,"ma200":2393.4,"close_vs_ma200":-25.8377,"close_vs_ma60":-15.8515,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-41.1074,"r2_60":0.2211,"slope_120":-12.3289,"r2_120":0.0375,"slope_250":-47.8804,"r2_250":0.8227,"high52":3725.0,"low52":1613.0,"pos_52w":7.6705,"dd_52w":-52.349,"mdd_1y":-53.9617,"atr14_pct":9.4044,"vol_ann_60":47.52,"vol_avg20":11284.15,"vol_ratio20":0.4028,"vr5":1.118,"vr20":0.6384,"amount_avg5":24108640.6,"amount_avg20":21789995.15,"amount_avg60":27535215.05,"obv_chg20":-58.1639,"turnover_20":2.0458,"pv_eff_20":-10.743,"rsi14":33.9622,"frgn_net_5":1889.0,"inst_net_5":1.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0171,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0171,"frgn_net_20":-37733.0,"inst_net_20":2.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.342,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.342,"frgn_net_60":-53661.0,"inst_net_60":2.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.4864,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.4864,"frgn_net_120":55050.0,"inst_net_120":-2669.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.499,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0242,"smart_net_120_pct":0.4748,"foreign_ratio":1.54,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.41,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":3.0,"op_margin_q":1.1152,"op_qoq":200.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":null,"rev_yoy":8.0321,"op_trend_4q":90.5263,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-1.12,"debt_ratio":123.58,"per":null,"pbr":0.48,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.54,"ta